{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05290","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得风字 · 李迥秀","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制得风字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重九临商节，登高出汉宫。\n正逢萸实满，还对菊花丛。\n霁云开就日，仙藻丽秋风。\n微臣预在镐，窃拚遂无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李迥秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}